    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 157,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "Ah, rich in sorrow, thou,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Stoop thy maternal brow,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And mark with pitying eye my misery!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The sword in thy pierced heart,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Thou dost with bitter smart,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Gaze upwards on thy Son’s death agony.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "To the dear God on high,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Ascends thy piteous sigh,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Pleading for his and thy sore misery.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Ah, who can know",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The torturing woe,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The pangs that rack me to the bone?",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "How my poor heart, without relief,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Trembles and throbs, its yearning grief",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Thou knowest, thou alone!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Ah, wheresoe’er I go,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "With woe, with woe, with woe,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My anguish’d breast is aching!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "When all alone I creep,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "I weep, I weep, I weep,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Alas! my heart is breaking!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The flower-pots at my window",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Were wet with tears of mine,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The while I pluck’d these blossoms,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "At dawn to deck thy shrine!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "When early in my chamber",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Shone bright the rising morn,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "I sat there on my pallet,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My heart with anguish torn.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Help! from disgrace and death deliver me!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Ah! rich in sorrow, thou,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Stoop thy maternal brow,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And mark with pitying eye my misery!",
       "i": 0
      }
