     "s": "Margaret"
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 163,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "Almighty God! I am undone!",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "speaker",
     "pg": 163,
     "s": "Valentine"
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 163,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "I’m dying—’tis a soon-told tale,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And sooner done the deed.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Why, women, do ye howl and wail?",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "To my last words give heed! (All gather round him.)",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My Gretchen, see! still young art thou,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Art not discreet enough, I trow,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Thou dost thy matters ill;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Let this in confidence be said:",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Since thou the path of shame dost tread,",
       "i": 0
      },
